-- Glacial Spike's 3-stage ramp (200025 Windup 1, 200026 Windup 2, 200027 Impact - see
-- spell_mage_glacial_spike::BeginRamp in spell_mage.cpp) previously reused SpellVisualID 13337
-- (Icicle-themed placeholder). Swapping to 10582, a stock 3.3.5a SpellVisual.dbc row that
-- already flies the plain Spells\Frostbolt.mdx missile (SpellVisualEffectName 259,
-- "Frostbolt Missile", scale 1.0) with every CastKit/ImpactKit/etc. left at 0 - i.e. just the
-- raw model, no particle trail - already a valid, in-use SpellVisualID (also used by real
-- spells like 116/7322 Frostbolt itself), not a new/invented value, so no client patch is
-- needed. Regenerated via apps/dbc-tools/generate.py after editing
-- apps/dbc-tools/source/spells/mage.csv's SpellVisualID_1 overrides for these 3 rows; only
-- these 3 spell_dbc rows are included here even though a full generate.py run currently also
-- flags ~4400 unrelated pre-existing spells as "editing existing" (see the flagged note in
-- this session's chat - looks like drift between the pulled reference CSVs and the base SQL
-- dump, unrelated to this change and not something to fix here).
DELETE FROM `spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (200025, 200026, 200027);

